:ProjectPlanning rdfs:comment "An engineering activity concerned with defining a project's scope, objectives, tasks, schedule, resources, and dependencies."@en ;
                 rdfs:label "Project planning"@en ;
                 <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/isPrimaryTopicOf> <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Project_planning> .


:ProofConcept rdfs:comment "A language concept concerning the representation, construction, or verification of formal proofs, typically supported by proof languages and proof assistants."@en ;
              rdfs:label "Proof concept"@en .


:Prototyping <http://www.softlang.org/ontologies/tbox#hasOutputArtifact> <http://www.softlang.org/ontologies/ae#ModelArtifact> ,
